With terrible screams, you burst out of the thickets, running toward the savages, waving the burning torches. Your sudden appearance had the effect of an exploded bomb. Some savages dropped their spears and fled into the forest, yelling in fear. Others fell to their knees, shaking and covering their heads with their hands. As you reached the clearing where the natives were dancing, a sudden movement from the right caught your attention. You quickly turned and saw a cage with Snoopy inside. He barked and jumped at the cage bars, showing his joy as if he were not captive on the alien island.